    "Scouting Notes": "Really good athlete at his size.\n Seemed to have made huge strides in his swing in 2021. I still think he has a better bat path and a more consistent swing than when he was drafted.\n The issue is his swing decisions. They're bad, and he has had a lot of swing and miss in his game.\n He still shows the raw power, but can't get to it as consistently in High A as he did in Low A. \n Defensively I haven't loved what I've seen either.\n There's still a big ceiling here, but I think he's very unlikely to reach it. Moving down my list quickly.",
